name overlock
category Package
revision 56079
shortdesc Overlock sans fonts with LaTeX support
longdesc The package provides the Overlock and OverlockSC families of
longdesc fonts, designed by Dario Manuel Muhafara of the TIPO foundry
longdesc (http://www.tipo.net.ar), "rounded" sans-serif fonts in three
longdesc weights (Regular, Bold, Black) with italic variants for each of
longdesc them. There are also small-caps and old-style figures in the
longdesc Regular weight.
execute addMap overlock.map
containersize 590276
containerchecksum 0c3754d8fce4d3a9b68cd4d8e23d8f53d03ca3e1a1fa81e1af9fc7148bc5376cb8fe15869696667bb109829817178c1f5a6262a10f42c55c00ece4a3e8beef5f
